          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A deterioration in energy supply stability tied to the Russia–Ukraine war (i.e., reduced European/Russian supply reliability) prompts buyers to reallocate purchases toward additional seaborne Middle Eastern crude, increasing tanker traffic and crude export volumes transiting the Strait of Hormuz; conversely, an improvement in supply stability would reduce that flow." />
