          <attvalue for="32" value="-" />
          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A drop in investor confidence due to escalation in the Russia–Ukraine war raises risk premia and speculative positioning in energy markets, directly elevating market expectations of supply risk for chokepoints such as the Strait of Hormuz (and a rise in investor confidence would lower those expectations)." />
