          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Visible attacks on commercial shipping that implicate automated navigation or port automation systems lead regulators to open inquiries and demand audits, controls, and reporting requirements for AI deployed in maritime-critical systems." />
