          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A rise in hostile incidents against commercial shipping increases insurers' and shippers' costs and causes short-term revenue volatility and supply-chain interruption for trade-exposed firms, raising default and liquidity risk perceptions and widening corporate credit spreads." />
