          <attvalue for="28" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Tighter export controls, screening and investment restrictions on advanced technologies directly block and delay inbound FDI, cross‑border venture funding and licensing deals in affected sectors, producing an immediate measurable decline in cross‑border capital flows to those industries and jurisdictions." />
