          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A rise in strategic tensions increases perceived geopolitical and sanction risk for governments closely tied to the rivalry, prompting creditors to demand higher risk premia and thus pushing up those sovereigns' bond yields." />
