          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Rising US–China strategic rivalry drives increased naval deployments, more aggressive freedom‑of‑navigation operations, and intensified proxy signaling in the Gulf, which raises the incidence of hostile encounters and deliberate attacks against commercial shipping transiting Hormuz." />
