          <attvalue for="35" value="Widening corporate credit spreads raise borrowing and refinancing costs for tanker owners and oil traders (commercial paper, bond rolls, working-capital lines) and increase insurance costs, prompting firms to delay/cancel voyages and reduce loadings through the Strait of Hormuz." />
          <attvalue for="36" value="0-6 months" />
