          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Widening corporate credit spreads raise defense and logistics firms' cost of capital and working-capital constraints, delaying production and delivery schedules for materiel that comprise military aid." />
