          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A drop in bank liquidity constrains energy firms' ability to finance fuel imports, maintenance and settlement of cross-border transactions, increasing the likelihood of outages and degrading energy supply stability." />
